{'symbol': 'CMG', 'date': '2021-06-22 08:03:00', 'title': 'CHIPOTLE LAUNCHES REWARDS EXCHANGE WITH NEW VIDEO GAME AND TESLA MODEL 3 GIVEAWAY', 'text': 'NEWPORT BEACH, CALIF., JUNE 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CHIPOTLE MEXICAN GRILL (NYSE: CMG) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT IS CELEBRATING THE LAUNCH OF REWARDS EXCHANGE, THE BIGGEST UPDATE TO THE CHIPOTLE REWARDS PROGRAM SINCE ITS DEBUT IN 2019, BY INTRODUCING A NEW VIDEO GAME CALLED CHIPOTLE RACE TO REWARDS EXCHANGE ON JUNE 23.'}